@MyFirstApi_cs_HostAddress = http://localhost:5203

### List products
GET {{MyFirstApi_cs_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Create product
POST {{MyFirstApi_cs_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Wireless Keyboard",
	"description": "Compact mechanical keyboard",
	"price": 79.99,
	"stockQuantity": 25
}

### Get product by ID
GET {{MyFirstApi_cs_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Replace product
PUT {{MyFirstApi_cs_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Wireless Keyboard Pro",
	"description": "Updated mechanical keyboard",
	"price": 99.99,
	"stockQuantity": 12
}

### Delete product
DELETE {{MyFirstApi_cs_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
